{"chroma:document":"Sandoval Kerr: Risk, Compliance and Insurance Review > Training\nEvery fee earner completes four hours of conflicts and ethics training each year, and completion is a condition of the annual pay review. Partners complete an additional session on engagement terms.","doc_id":"doc-104","title":"Sandoval Kerr: Risk, Compliance and Insurance Review","fingerprints":"6e50cc0f46cdc73a"